sequenceDiagram
    participant A0 as CPU (M0)
    participant A1 as IP CSR (S1)
    participant A2 as DMA (M1)
    participant A3 as Memory (S0)
    participant A4 as UART
    A0->>A1: Single writes: AW + W handshakes
    A1-->>A0: B handshake for each CSR write
    A1->>A2: START: SRC=0x100, LEN=4, CTRL=1
    A2->>A3: AR: ADDR=0x100, LEN=3, SIZE=2, INCR
    A3-->>A2: R beat 0: H; RVALID && RREADY
    A3-->>A2: R beats 1,2: W,1; handshakes only
    A3-->>A2: R beat 3: !; RLAST=1
    A2->>A4: Serialize H, W, 1, ! as 8N1
    A4-->>A2: Final stop bit completed
    A2->>A1: DMA_DONE=1
    A0->>A1: AR read STATUS; accept R response
